### LogLens API quick requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension: click "Send Request")
@base = http://localhost:8000

GET {{base}}/health

### Runtime config
GET {{base}}/api/v1/config

### Datasets
GET {{base}}/api/v1/datasets

### Load a synthetic sample
POST {{base}}/api/v1/datasets/samples/ssh-bruteforce

### Upload a file
POST {{base}}/api/v1/datasets/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="source_type"

NGINX
--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="suspicious_access.log"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./sample_data/nginx/suspicious_access.log
--b--

### Events (filters + pagination)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/events?source_ip=203.0.113.45&status_code=404&page=1&page_size=20

### Alerts
GET {{base}}/api/v1/alerts?severity=HIGH

### Dashboard
GET {{base}}/api/v1/dashboard/summary

### Exports
GET {{base}}/api/v1/exports/events.csv?status_code=404
###
GET {{base}}/api/v1/exports/alerts.json
